sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Agent as LLM Agent
    participant Tool1 as Calculator Tool
    participant Tool2 as Weather Tool
    participant Tool3 as Wikipedia Tool

    User->>Agent: "What is 2^10 and weather in Tokyo?"
    Agent->>Agent: Parse intent, identify sub-tasks
    Agent->>Tool1: calculate("2**10")
    Tool1-->>Agent: Result: 1024
    Agent->>Tool2: get_weather("Tokyo")
    Tool2-->>Agent: Result: Sunny, 22°C
    Agent->>Agent: Compose final response
    Agent-->>User: "2^10 = 1024. The weather in Tokyo is sunny at 22°C."
    User->>Agent: "Who discovered penicillin?"
    Agent->>Tool3: wikipedia("penicillin discovery")
    Tool3-->>Agent: Alexander Fleming, 1928
    Agent-->>User: "Penicillin was discovered by Alexander Fleming in 1928."
